From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 06:32:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] quickjs: Bump servo-quickjs for shared runtime-state access

servo-quickjs cbf02ee reaches the shim's per-runtime state (Cx) only
through shared references, and keeps the state that natives, hooks and
finalizers change while Rust code uses it in cells. Before, the shim
held a &mut Cx across calls that re-enter it, which Rust's aliasing
rules forbid; 78daccd only avoided the miscompile this caused in the
autorelease pool's drain. cbf02ee also stops keeping three borrows of
object data (Intl objects, realm intrinsics, proxy slots) across frees
and allocations.

Validation: `./mach build --release --js-engine quickjs` and `xvfb-run ./mach smoketest --release` passed. A release build of the same Rust code (shim 809296d, the same tree as cbf02ee) ran the 7670-test WPT subset (dom, webidl, html/webappapis, html/semantics/scripting-1, fetch/api, streams, workers, IndexedDB, ...) with QJS_VERIFY_TRACING=1: no verifier report, and the same results as the previous shim but for seven tests, of which the four worse ones behaved the same with both shims in 5 reruns.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; written by the agent, which also ran the build, smoketest and WPT runs above)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 support/quickjs/cargo-config.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/support/quickjs/cargo-config.toml b/support/quickjs/cargo-config.toml
index b62d51e5349..3431cd22256 100644
--- a/support/quickjs/cargo-config.toml
+++ b/support/quickjs/cargo-config.toml
@@ -5,4 +5,4 @@
 # were tested with. The shim's version must match the mozjs version that Cargo.toml requires, or
 # Cargo leaves the patch unused.
 [patch.crates-io]
-mozjs = { git = "https://github.com/openharmony-rs/servo-quickjs", rev = "78daccddca57c745b830b5486b0e6bec4de40587" }
+mozjs = { git = "https://github.com/openharmony-rs/servo-quickjs", rev = "cbf02ee851f7f60b39c3b0ed99a81c99f759bd98" }
